#: attendeeselector.cpp:37
msgid "Select Attendees"
msgstr "Deelnehmers utsöken"

#: attendeeselector.cpp:57
msgid "Click to add a new attendee"
msgstr "Klick hier, wenn Du en nieg Deelnehmer tofögen wullt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, addButton)
#: attendeeselector.ui:24
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Tofögen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, removeButton)
#: attendeeselector.ui:37
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Wegmaken"

#: delegateselector.cpp:39
msgid "Select delegate"
msgstr "Viez utsöken"

#: delegateselector.cpp:53
msgid "Delegate:"
msgstr "Afgeven:"

#: delegateselector.cpp:56
msgid "Keep me informed about status changes of this incidence."
msgstr "Mi över Ännern för dit Begeefnis op Stand hollen"

#: text_calendar.cpp:366
#, kde-format
msgid "No attachment named \"%1\" found in the invitation."
msgstr "Keen Bilaag mit den Naam \"%1\" binnen de Inladen funnen"

#: text_calendar.cpp:374
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The invitation attachment \"%1\" is a web link that is inaccessible from "
"this computer. Please ask the event organizer to resend the invitation with "
"this attachment stored inline instead of a link."
msgstr ""
"De Inladen-Bilaag \"%1\" is en Nettlink, op den sik vun dissen Reekner nich "
"togriepen lett. Fraag bitte den Utrichter vun't Begeefnis, wat he de Inladen "
"nochmaal mit de Bilaag binnenreegs ansteed as Link loosstüern kann."

#: text_calendar.cpp:428
msgid ""
"<qt>None of your identities match the receiver of this message,<br/>please "
"choose which of the following addresses is yours, if any, or select one of "
"your identities to use in the reply:</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>De Adressaat vun disse Naricht passt op keen vun Dien Identiteten<br/"
">söök bitte de Adress ut, de Dien is, oder söök een vun Dien Identiteten för "
"de Antwoort ut:</qt>"

#: text_calendar.cpp:434
msgid ""
"<qt>Several of your identities match the receiver of this message,<br/"
">please choose which of the following addresses is yours:</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>De Adressaat vun disse Naricht passt op mehr vun Dien Identiteten,<br/"
">giff bitte de Adress an, de Dien is:</qt>"

#: text_calendar.cpp:449
msgid "Select Address"
msgstr "Adress utsöken"

#: text_calendar.cpp:510
msgid "Answer: "
msgstr "Antwoort: "

#: text_calendar.cpp:513
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Not able to attend."
msgid "Declined: %1"
msgstr "Afwiest: %1"

#: text_calendar.cpp:516
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Unsure if it is possible to attend."
msgid "Tentative: %1"
msgstr "Vörlöpig: %1"

#: text_calendar.cpp:519
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Accepted the invitation."
msgid "Accepted: %1"
msgstr "Annahmen: %1"

#: text_calendar.cpp:668
msgid "Incidence with no summary"
msgstr "Begeefnis ahn Tosamenfaten"

#: text_calendar.cpp:673
#, kde-format
msgid "Answer: %1"
msgstr "Antwoort: %1"

#: text_calendar.cpp:676
#, kde-format
msgid "Delegated: %1"
msgstr "Afgeven: %1"

#: text_calendar.cpp:679
#, kde-format
msgid "Forwarded: %1"
msgstr "Wiederleddt: %1"

#: text_calendar.cpp:682
#, kde-format
msgid "Declined Counter Proposal: %1"
msgstr "Afwiest Gegenvörslag: %1"

#: text_calendar.cpp:733 text_calendar.cpp:739
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\" occurred already."
msgstr "\"%1\" al schehn"

#: text_calendar.cpp:735 text_calendar.cpp:753
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\" is currently in-progress."
msgstr "\"%1\" is jüst nu togang"

#: text_calendar.cpp:741
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\", happening all day today, is currently in-progress."
msgstr "\"%1\", vundaag den helen Dag över, is jüst nu togang"

#: text_calendar.cpp:751 text_calendar.cpp:763
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\" is past due."
msgstr "\"%1\" is över de Tiet"

#: text_calendar.cpp:757
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\" has already started."
msgstr "\"%1\" hett al anfungen."

#: text_calendar.cpp:766
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\", happening all-day today, is currently in-progress."
msgstr "\"%1\", vundaag den helen Dag över, is jüst nu togang"

#: text_calendar.cpp:771
#, kde-format
msgid "\"%1\", happening all day, has already started."
msgstr "\"%1\", duert den helen Dag lang, hett al anfungen"

#: text_calendar.cpp:781
msgid "Do you still want to accept the task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du de Opgaav liekers annehmen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:783
msgid "Do you still want to accept the invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du de Inladen liekers annehmen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:788
msgid "Do you still want to send conditional acceptance of the invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du för de Inladen liekers en Annahm mit Beding loosstüern?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:790
msgid "Do you still want to send conditional acceptance of the task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du för de Opgaav liekers en Annahm mit Beding loosstüern?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:793
msgid "Do you still want to accept the counter proposal?"
msgstr "Wullt Du den Gegenvörslag liekers annehmen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:795
msgid "Do you still want to send a counter proposal?"
msgstr "Wullt Du liekers en Gegenvörslag loosstüern?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:797
msgid "Do you still want to send a decline response?"
msgstr "Wullt Du liekers en Afwiesen loosstüern?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:799
msgid "Do you still want to decline the counter proposal?"
msgstr "Wullt Du den Gegenvörslag liekers afwiesen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:801
msgid "Do you still want to record this response in your calendar?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Anter liekers binnen Dien Kalenner opteken?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:804
msgid "Do you still want to delegate this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav liekers afgeven?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:806
msgid "Do you still want to delegate this invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen liekers afgeven?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:810
msgid "Do you still want to forward this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav liekers wiederledden?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:812
msgid "Do you still want to forward this invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen liekers wiederledden?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:816
msgid "Do you still want to cancel this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav noch torüchnehmen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:818
msgid "Do you still want to cancel this invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen noch torüchnehmen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:821
msgid "Do you still want to check your calendar?"
msgstr "Wullt Du liekers Dien Terminen pröven?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:824
msgid "Do you still want to record this task in your calendar?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav liekers binnen Dien Kalenner opteken?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:826
msgid "Do you still want to record this invitation in your calendar?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen liekers binnen Dien Kalenner opteken?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:830
msgid "Do you really want to cancel this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav redig torüchnehmen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:832
msgid "Do you really want to cancel this invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen redig torüchnehmen?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:837
#, kde-format
msgid "%1?"
msgstr "%1?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:842
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"%1\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"%1\n"
"%2"

#: text_calendar.cpp:871
msgid "Reaction to Invitation"
msgstr "Antwoort op Inladen"

#: text_calendar.cpp:871 text_calendar.cpp:1131
msgid "Comment:"
msgstr "Kommentar:"

#: text_calendar.cpp:878 text_calendar.cpp:1138
msgid "You forgot to add proposal. Please add it. Thanks"
msgstr "Du hest keen Vörslag biföögt, maak dat bitte noch. Dank ok."

#: text_calendar.cpp:914
msgid "Delegation to organizer is not possible."
msgstr "Afgeven na den Utrichter is nich mööglich"

#: text_calendar.cpp:1047
msgid "Save Invitation Attachment"
msgstr "Inladen-Bilaag sekern"

#: text_calendar.cpp:1054
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "File <filename>%1</filename> exists.<nl/> Do you want to replace it?"
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft de Datei <filename>%1</filename> al.<nl/> Wullt Du ehr "
"överschrieven?"

#: text_calendar.cpp:1131
msgid "Decline Counter Proposal"
msgstr "Gegenvörslag afwiesen"

#: text_calendar.cpp:1178
msgid ""
"You have no writable calendar folders for invitations, so storing or saving "
"a response will not be possible.\n"
"Please create at least 1 writable events calendar and re-sync."
msgstr ""
"Dien Kalenner bargt keen schriefbor Ornern för Inladen, dat heet, Sekern "
"oder spiekern vun Antwoorden geiht nich.\n"
"Bitte stell tominnst een schriefbor Begeefniskalenner op un synkroniseer "
"nieg."

#: text_calendar.cpp:1198
msgid ""
"The calendar invitation stored in this email message is broken in some way. "
"Unable to continue."
msgstr ""
"Disse Nettbreef bargt en schaadhaftig Inladen. Wiedermaken nich mööglich."

#: text_calendar.cpp:1255
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The organizer is not expecting a reply to this invitation but you can send "
"them an email message if you desire.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to send the organizer a message regarding this invitation?\n"
"Press the [Cancel] button to cancel the recording operation."
msgstr ""
"De Utrichter verwacht keen Antwoort op de Inladen, man Du kannst em liekers "
"een tostüern.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du em wegen de Inladen en Naricht tostüern?\n"
"Klick op \"Afbreken\", wenn Du afbreken wullt."

#: text_calendar.cpp:1259
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Send Email to Organizer"
msgstr "Den Utrichter en Nettbreef tostüern"

#: text_calendar.cpp:1260
msgid "Do Not Send"
msgstr "Nich loosstüern"

#: text_calendar.cpp:1261
